<h3><u>Ya Habibi Ya Hussain</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>YA HUSSAINA YA IMAMAL MAZLUMEENA YA HUSSAINA YA IMAMAL MASUMEENA</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>YA HUSSAINA</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>(YA HABIBI YA HUSSAIN YA SHAFI YA HUSSAIN) X2 YA GHARIBI YA HUSSAIN</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>HE WAS HUSSAIN THE GRANDSON OF PROPHET MUHAMMAD, SALALLAHU ALAYHI WASALLAM</p>

<p>HUSSAIN MERCY UPON MANKIND, SAVIOUR OF ALL MANKIND</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>YA HABIBI YA HUSSAIN YA SHAFI YA HUSSAIN (2) YA GHARIBI YA HUSSAIN</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>RAB KI RAZA SE JISNE GARDAN KATAYI, DEEN-E- NABI KI JISNE LAAJ BACHAYI</p>

<p>HAR GHAR MEI JISKA FARSHE MATAM BICHA HAI (2)</p>

<p>ROTI HAI JISKE GHAM MEI SARI KHUDAAI</p>

<p>YA HABIBI YA HUSSAIN</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>YA HABIBI YA HUSSAIN YA SHAFI YA HUSSAIN (2) YA GHARIBI YA HUSSAIN</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>MEHMA(N) GHAR KE USKO KUFA BULAAYA BAYYAT-E-YAZID KA WOH MASLA UTHAAYA</p>

<p>BOLE HUSSAIN KABI MEI NAA KARUNGA (2)</p>

<p>SAJDE MEI JISNE APNE SAR KO KATAYA</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>ZEHRA AUR HAIDER JISKA JHULA JHULAYE, KHATM-E-MURSAL BHI JISKE NAAZ UTHAAYE</p>

<p>KHAALI SAWAALI JISKE GHAR SE NAA JAAYE (2)</p>

<p>HAL MIN KI DETA HAI WOH BAN MEI SADAAYE</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>AKBAR SA BETA DIYA GHAZI SA BHAAYI, LUTI GAYI HAI RAN MEI JISKI KAMAAYI</p>

<p>AB BHI GAWA HAI USKI SHAAM-E- GHARIBAA (2)</p>

<p>APNE LAHU SE SHAMMA DEEN KI JALAAYI</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>KOYI NAA DEKHA HAMNE AISA NAMAAZI, DEEN-E-NABI PE JISNE HAR SHAY&#39; LUTAYI</p>

<p>PHOOL BAHATAR DIYE RAAHE KHUDA MEI (2)</p>

<p>SAB KUCH LUTAKE KIYA ALLAH KO RAAZI</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>&quot;JAWAAD-O-MESUM&quot; USKA MATAM HAI GHAR GHAR, ROYE JANAAZE JISNE PYAARO KE DIN BHAR</p>

<p>PHERA GAYA HAI JISKI GARDAN PE KHANJAR (2)</p>

<p>CHINI GAYI HAI JISKI BEHNA KI CHADAR</p>
</p>